[00:00.00]Grandma's garden is waking up.|奶奶的菜园醒来了。
[00:05.20]Good morning, Grandma. Where are you going?|早上好，奶奶。你要去哪儿？
[00:08.44]Good morning, sweetie. I'm going to pick vegetables.|早上好，宝贝。我去摘菜。
[00:13.14]Pick vegetables? I want to go with you!|摘菜？我想跟你一起去！
[00:17.92]Sure. Let's go to the garden.|好啊，我们去菜园吧。
[00:25.64]Look! These are fresh red tomatoes.|你看！这些是新鲜的红番茄。
[00:30.00]Wow, they look so nice.|哇，看起来真好。
[00:34.08]These are green cucumbers. Let's pick them.|这些是绿黄瓜。我们摘吧。
[00:39.82]Pick, pick. Like this?|摘呀摘。是这样吗？
[00:42.54]Yes. Good job.|对，做得好。
[00:47.16]Let's pull carrots and onions.|我们来拔胡萝卜和洋葱。
[00:50.98]Pull, pull. They are heavy.|拔呀拔。好重呀。
[00:53.06]Look at the broccoli. Let's pick some.|你看那西兰花。我们摘一些吧。
[01:01.32]Big broccoli! Put it in the basket.|好大的西兰花！放进篮子里。
[01:06.44]Great job.|做得真棒。
[01:08.78]Look! So many veggies.|你看！好多蔬菜呀。
[01:11.70]They are yummy. I love staying with you.|真好吃。我喜欢跟你在一起。
[01:15.56]I love you too, Grandma.|我也爱你，奶奶。
